<section class="hx-page-heading"><p class="hx-eyebrow">CUSTOMER SUPPORT</p><h1>Help &amp; common questions</h1><p class="hx-muted">Clear next steps for payments, products and digital delivery.</p></section><section class="hx-panel"><h2>Where do I find my key?</h2><p>After a successful delivery, sign in and open <a href="/keys">My Key</a>. If a payment succeeded but delivery is still pending, check <a href="/orders">My orders</a> before submitting another payment.</p></section><section class="hx-panel"><h2>When is a wallet top-up credited?</h2><p>UPI credits after FamGateway confirms the payment and the paid amount matches the request. Binance Pay top-ups remain pending until an administrator independently verifies the transfer and your transaction ID and screenshot.</p></section><section class="hx-panel"><h2>Can I retry a failed delivery?</h2><p>Do not pay again. The shop's admin checks the reseller transaction before retrying so an uncertain supplier response does not duplicate a key issue.</p></section><section class="hx-panel"><h2>Need more help?</h2><p>Use the support contact published by the shop administrator, and include only your order ID. Never send passwords or payment card details.</p></section>
